{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國在海南商業航天發射場今日（25日）上午10時03分，使用長征八號甲運載火箭，將衛星互聯網低軌28組衛星發射升空，衛星順利進入預定軌道，發射任務成功。</p><p>（央視新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.184539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798271+00:00","content_hash":"b06b3120901a439ffdc812257bd44a4a51da3bb5fbb033757593f2df3862e864","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}